# Files excluded from deployments (they never reach the content server).
# Without this file, sdk-commands falls back to defaults and packs several MB
# of editor/tooling artifacts into every deploy.

# Creator Hub asset-browser thumbnail cache (~2.7MB of 300x300 PNGs)
thumbnails/
# SDK docs kept locally for AI-assistant context
dclcontext/
# Local data snapshots
backups/
# Editor / assistant / tooling configuration
.claude/
.editor/
.vscode/
.idea/
cursor.config
cursorignore
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
# Build & dependency trees (also in the default ignore, kept explicit)
node_modules/
bin/*.map
.dclcache/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
*.log
